  "title": "Introducing the Ultra ↔ Ethereum Bridge",
  "summary": "Today Ultra releases a dedicated bridge interface that enables users to move assets between Ultra’s Layer-1 and Ethereum. The bridge is designed as infrastructure to be simple, transparent, and centered on execution. Ultra provides and maintains an interface, while the underlying bridge protocol is operated by independent validators. How it works The Ultra Bridge enables […]",
